                  "text": "AMS 5666"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Nickel Alloy: 625"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Product Forms: Nickel Alloy, Corrosion and Heat-Resistant, Bars, Forgings, Extrusions, and Rings"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Condition: Annealed"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Scope: This specification covers a corrosion and heat-resistant nickel alloy in the form of bars, forgings, extrusions, flash welded rings, and stock for forging, extruding, or flash welded rings up to 10 inches (254 mm) in diameter or least cross-sectional dimension."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Product availability:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Nickel Alloy 625 Round Bar](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-nickel-alloy-round-bar)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "DISCLAIMER: The use of this information should be considered strictly voluntary. Information contained in this page or across the domain, may contain typographical errors and are for reference only. Information presented are purely generalizations and are not a substitution for AMS specifications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "DISCLAIMER: Alloy data sheets are for reference only, not for design purposes."
                },
                {
